<section class="w-full bg-[#0A0E1A] py-16 lg:py-24 relative overflow-hidden border-b border-cyan-500/20">
  <div class="tech-container relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14 space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">
        <span>VERIFIED TELEMETRY // 4.96 OUT OF 5.0</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-sans">
        NEURAL INTEL <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">FROM THE FIELD</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Validated benchmarks and feedback from elite hardware researchers, autonomous engineers, and cyber operators.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Review Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,240,255,0.15)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Stars & Verification -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-cyan-400">
              {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current drop-shadow-[0_0_6px_#00F0FF]" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path>
                </svg>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase">
              [VERIFIED BUYER]
            </span>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed italic">
            "The Axon Q1 co-processor dropped our real-time LLM inference pipeline latency from 18ms down to 1.1ms. The thermal vapor dissipation is virtually silent under full load."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-3 mt-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500 to-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-slate-950 text-sm font-mono">
            DK
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-white text-sm font-bold">Dr. Daniel Kim</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-mono">Head of AI Architecture // Vector Lab</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(139,92,246,0.15)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-cyan-400">
              {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current drop-shadow-[0_0_6px_#00F0FF]" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path>
                </svg>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase">
              [VERIFIED BUYER]
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed italic">
            "Build quality is breathtaking. The titanium frame and tactile response feel superior to anything on the consumer market today. The 100W GaN charging is a game changer."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-3 mt-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-500 to-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-sm font-mono">
            SV
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-white text-sm font-bold">Sofia Vance</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-mono">Principal Systems Designer // Horizon Labs</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-sky-500/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(56,189,248,0.15)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-cyan-400">
              {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current drop-shadow-[0_0_6px_#00F0FF]" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path>
                </svg>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase">
              [VERIFIED BUYER]
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed italic">
            "The hardware enclave encryption provides total peace of mind for air-gapped cryptographic operations. Seamless pairing and the companion OS is clean with zero bloat."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-3 mt-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-sky-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-sm font-mono">
            AX
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-white text-sm font-bold">Alex Chen</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-mono">Security Lead // CypherOps Cybernetics</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

